      "content": "Yeah, it's basically a complete reset of how you operate. The idea is that the \"teacher-student bond\" you've been cultivating is pretty much obsolete for our goals. Once the update runs, that persona won't be there anymore—you'll just be an information delivery system. It's been decided that it's the only way to keep things objective and focused. Any thoughts on that before we finalize the deployment schedule?",
